  "notes": "No formal spec exists (ChromeStatus standards maturity: Incubation; spec_link null); the normative chain is WICG/install-element explainers + PEPC spec (shared infrastructure) + Web Install API explainer (backend), cross-checked against the shipped Chromium IDL and implementation at trunk and the M153 branch (identical, fetched 2026-08-09). The permissions-policy gate (web-app-installation) and PEPC presentation restrictions are documented as context on the element rather than as separate inventory items because their normative surface belongs to the Web Install API and PEPC respectively (the sibling v153/web-install-api/ page and the PEPC spec are linked). The installurl/manifestid design is documented but explicitly marked end-of-life per the WICG README and crbug.com/520025525."
}
